#   zora "Really? What are you like a personal trainer or something?"
    zora "Sério? Você é tipo um personal trainer ou algo assim?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:290
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_meets_Zora_c14c584c:

#   mc "Well..."
    mc "Bem..."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:292
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_meets_Zora_945a58df:

#   zora "Oh my God... Seriously??"
    zora "Meu Deus... Sério??"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:294
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_meets_Zora_3d2e58f8:

#   mc "Yeah, and I work at a local gym in town."
    mc "Sim, e eu trabalho em uma academia local na cidade."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:296
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_meets_Zora_843ed74e:

#   zora "I am so sorry."
    zora "Sinto muito."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:298
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_meets_Zora_b35102ae:

#   zora "That's typical of me."
    zora "Isso é típico de mim."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:300
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_meets_Zora_b2d3ef02:

#   zora "The one person I'm looking for, and I make a complete fool of myself before I've even started a session."
    zora "A única pessoa que procuro, e eu pago um mico completo antes mesmo de começar a sessão."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:304
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_meets_Zora_f4383496:

#   mc "Hey, it happens to the best of us."
    mc "Ei, isso acontece com os melhores."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:308
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_meets_Zora_c891e4eb:

#   mc "It's okay, you weren't to know."
    mc "Não tem problema, você não tinha como saber."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:314
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_meets_Zora_106efe30:

#   mc "So you're searching for a personal trainer then?"
    mc "Então você está procurando um personal trainer?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:316
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_meets_Zora_e98413b9:

#   zora "Yes, very much so."
    zora "Sim, com certeza."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:318
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_meets_Zora_78fcba86:

#   zora "And I can pay you well in advance for numerous sessions."
    zora "E posso te pagar com bastante antecedência por várias sessões."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:320
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_meets_Zora_863efb1b:

#   zora "I just want to do this right."
    zora "Só quero fazer isso direito."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:322
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_meets_Zora_ed1eb4f3:

#   mc "That's good. And I'd be more than happy to help you."
    mc "Que bom! E eu ficaria muito feliz em te ajudar."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:325
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_meets_Zora_79854a83:

#   zora "Can we start today?"
    zora "Podemos começar hoje?"

