#   mc "Sorry to bother you, but I was wondering if we could check out that security systems place."
    mc "Desculpe incomodar, mas eu gostaria de saber se poderíamos dar uma olhada naquela empresa de sistemas de segurança."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:446
translate brazil lb_ep01_12_03_MC_Calls_Ariel_37709da6:

#   mc "Preferably now."
    mc "De preferência agora."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:448
translate brazil lb_ep01_12_03_MC_Calls_Ariel_eb4416b3:

#   a "Oh, how come?"
    a "Ah, como assim?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:450
