#   mc "I'm free at the moment, and if we don't go soon, then I might not be able to help you later."
    mc "No momento estou livre, e se não formos logo, talvez eu não consiga te ajudar mais tarde."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:452
translate brazil lb_ep01_12_03_MC_Calls_Ariel_b9434291:

#   a "Hmm... It's a little sooner than I was planning to go there, but if I move some things around, then it can work."
    a "Hum... É um pouco mais cedo do que eu havia planejado ir para lá, mas se eu reorganizar algumas coisas, pode dar certo."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:454
translate brazil lb_ep01_12_03_MC_Calls_Ariel_4dc2460a:

#   a "But you're going to need to come home first, I have something that you'll need."
    a "Mas primeiro você precisa voltar para casa, tenho algo que você vai precisar."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:456
translate brazil lb_ep01_12_03_MC_Calls_Ariel_791cb027:

#   mc "Um... Okay."
    mc "Um... Okay."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/12_03_The_MC_Meets_Zora.rpy:458
